und-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/6a300b1ea7d8b.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/6a300b1ea7d8b.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">《阿斯报》消息，在皇马签下前锋埃斯皮后，巴西小将恩德里克正认真考虑再次外租，他希望加盟一支能参加欧战且能确保主力位置的球队。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-10/6a78c98f0cae3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世体：巴萨和曼城已接近就罗德里达成协议，只剩一些细节需要敲定</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.24" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260807/6a757ed363af0.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.24" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.24" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260807/6a757ed363af0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260807/6a757ed363af0.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据西班牙世界体育报报道，罗德里加盟巴萨的交易已经接近完成。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-10/6a78d11cc26a6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">Here We Go！罗马诺：21岁米兰后卫阿特卡梅租借至里昂，不含买断</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260810/202608100315555644_1280.jpg